---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import ActionLink from '../../components/ActionLink.astro';
import { href, asset, PROFILE } from '../../lib/url';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="IT support and a Proxmox home lab"
  description="Martín De Prada, IT support technician at a 24/7 distribution center in Madrid. He runs Bastion, a Proxmox home server with no ports open on the router, phone alerts, restore-tested backups and published failure write-ups."
  altHref={href('/')}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Martín De Prada · IT support · Madrid, Spain</span>
      <h1>IT support at a 24/7 distribution center. At home, a server I run and document.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        The server is Bastion: Proxmox with no ports open on the home router, alerts to my phone, backups I restored to
        check they actually work, and an AI agent that can read but not change anything. One backup job reported
        success while saving one machine out of three. The weekly AI report flagged it; I fixed it and wrote it up.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        I'm studying systems and network administration (ASIR, a Spanish higher technician diploma) and want to move from
        support into systems, cloud and security. Open to relocating to Germany or the Netherlands. My English is
        intermediate; I use it every day with technical and vendor documentation.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        The detailed write-up of Bastion is in Spanish for now. The English pages are being written from scratch, not
        machine-translated. I reply to emails within 24 hours.
      </p>
      <div class="en-actions">
        <Button href={asset('cv/CV_Martin_De_Prada_EN.pdf')} icon="download" download>Download my CV (PDF)</Button>
        <ActionLink href={`mailto:${PROFILE.email}`}>Email me</ActionLink>
        <ActionLink href={href('/bastion')}>See Bastion (in Spanish)</ActionLink>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Titular de frase completa: mismo tamaño que el de la portada en español para que quepa en móvil */
  h1 {
    max-width: 22ch;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .lead {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .en-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
